 "solution": "A：\\(x^{3}\\cdot x^{4}=x^{7}\\)，错。B：\\(x^{2}\\)与\\(x^{3}\\)不是同类项，不能合并，错。\nC：\\((3x^{2}y)^{2}=3^{2}(x^{2})^{2}y^{2}=9x^{4}y^{2}\\)，对。D：\\((x-2y)^{2}=x^{2}-4xy+4y^{2}\\)，错。选C。",
